      "usage": "held-in-one-hand",
      "category": "ammo",
      "description": "Activate 1 (manipulate) . The shaft of this bolt is scorched and blackened, and handling it coats your fingers with a fine black powder. When an activated disintegration bolt hits a target, it is subject to a spell requiring a fortitude check save. As with the spell, a critical hit on the attack roll causes the target's saving throw outcome to be one degree worse. . Craft Requirements Supply one casting of disintegrate.",
