      "description": "This bottle of frozen vapors is captured in the frozen peaks of the crown of the world. After inhaling frost breath, you gain resistance 5 to cold. You can exhale the frost breath as a single action to release a spray of frigid air in a @Template[cone|distance:15]. Each creature in the area takes 4d6[cold|options:area-damage] damage with a reflex check save. For 10 minutes, surfaces in the area are covered in ice, becoming difficult terrain and uneven ground (acrobatics check).",
