      "usage": "held-in-one-hand",
      "category": "other",
      "description": "Activate 1 (manipulate) Access Tian Xia origin . Though these preserved vegetables aren't actual moonflowers, they're made using a moonflower-distilled vinegar. When consumed, tendrils sprout from your veins and curl around you, granting you a +2 status bonus to saves against void effects for 10 minutes and reducing your wounded condition by up to 2. Eating more than one preserved moonflower dish in a day doesn't grant further benefits and makes you Drained 1.",
