      "description": "This wine, prepared using the blood of a creature with overwhelming vitality, soothes the body, mind, and spirit with a temporary sense of euphoria and rest. When you drink wine of the blood, you recover 2d10[healing]{2d10 Hit Points}. Additionally, the wine attempts to counteract every negative emotion effect affecting you, with a counteract rank of 3 and a counteract modifier of +9. Lastly, you gain a +1 status bonus to all Will saves, or a +2 status bonus against emotion effects, for 1 minute.",
