      "usage": "worn",
      "description": "An extra lung is a waterproofed bladder of air worn in an underarm holster, connected to the wearer's nose by a long tube. You can use it as a source of air instead of breathing in the air around you. It can hold 5 rounds' worth of breathable air, and can be refilled if the extra lung is left open for 10 minutes in an environment with suitable air. You can switch to breathing from the extra lung at any time, without using an action. You can use air from the bladder following the rules for holding your breath, but you can speak without losing the air from the extra lung. When you lose air at th...",
      "publicationTitle": "Pathfinder Rage of Elements",
