      "usage": "other",
      "description": "This large magical stew pot can boil objects down to their valuable components, greatly assisting anyone who wants to harvest raw materials without visiting a settlement. The cauldron is roughly 3 feet in diameter. . Activate 3 Interact Requirements The cauldron must be filled with boiling water for at least 1 hour . Effect As you stir the cauldron, one object that has been in it for at least an hour transforms into raw materials with a value of one half the object's Price; art objects are instead transformed into raw materials with a value equal to their Price. The cauldron produces raw mater...",
      "publicationTitle": "Pathfinder #182: Graveclaw",
