      "usage": "wornnecklace",
      "description": "This beaded pendant crafted by Lyrune-Quah shamans features an uncut moonstone that warns the wearer of danger. When a hostile creature comes within 30 feet of you, the stone glows with moonlight only you can see. Activate—Lunar Illumination 1 (concentrate) Frequency once per hour . Effect Bright moonlight shines out of the gem in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:30], forcing hostile creatures in the area to make a fortitude check save or be for 1 round.",
