      "description": "These panpipes are made of what seems to be beat-up tin bound by frayed leather and look like they shouldn't function at all, but in skilled hands they emit a beautiful sound that beguiles the senses. While playing the pipes, you gain a +2 item bonus to Diplomacy and Performance checks. . Activate Cast a Spell Effect You expend a number of charges from this instrument to cast a spell from its list. Cantrip 1st , , 2nd , 3rd , , , 4th , 5th , , , . Craft Requirements Supply one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells.",
      "publicationTitle": "Pathfinder Treasure Vault",
      "remaster": false,
