      "description": "Activate 1 Interact This metallic tube has a complex array of lenses and prisms at one end and a hatch at the other. The hatch can be unlocked, loaded with a Sunrod, and refastened using 3 Interact actions. A loaded sun dazzler can be activated to burn the sunrod to dust in a single focused flash, creating a @Template[cone|distance:30] of scintillating light. All creatures in the cone must attempt a fortitude check save, with the following effects. . Critical Success The creature is unaffected. Success The creature is for 1 round. Failure The creature is for 1 round or until it spends an Inter...",
